What is the storyline of JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure?

Context:
The world of JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure mirrors our own reality but incorporates supernatural powers and entities. Within this realm, certain individuals can convert their inner spiritual energy into a Stand (スタンド, Sutando), while another major energy source is Hamon (波紋, “Ripple”), a combat technique that lets its practitioner channel bodily vitality into sunlight through regulated breathing. The saga is divided into distinct arcs, each featuring its own plot and cast of characters. Every main protagonist belongs to the Joestar lineage, whose direct heirs bear a star‑shaped birthmark on the left side of their upper back and a name that can be shortened to “JoJo.” The initial six arcs occur in a single continuity, driven by the generational feud between Jonathan Joestar and Dio Brando;
